# Reports are regenerable via dvc repro and stay out of git — except figure
# specs, which are committed as deployable artifacts (see deploy/DEPLOY.md).
# The RAG retrieval index (data/index/) is the opt-in exception: enable chat
# by running `dvc repro` in this project on the host.
/reports/*
!/reports/figures/
/reports/*.json
/reports/*.html
# …except the runtime-served summary files (the API serves both at
# /projects/01-rag-agent/{metrics,report}) — same rationale as DEPLOY.md.
!/reports/metrics.json
!/reports/report.html
